Key Rules of CC BY-NC-SABY (Attribution):
BY (Attribution): You must give credit to the original creator, provide a link to the license, and point out if changes were made.
NC (NonCommercial): You cannot use the material for primary monetary gain or commercial advantage.
SA (ShareAlike): If you remix, adapt, or build upon the material, your new work must be shared under the exact same or a compatible license. 
